/E (This project focuses on building a complete vSphere environment using VMware Workstation as a lab platform. The environment includes multiple ESXi hosts connected to a centralized vCenter Server, allowing the implementation of advanced VMware features such as vMotion, High Availability \(HA\), Distributed Resource Scheduler \(DRS\), Fault Tolerance \(FT\), and shared storage management.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
