/P 526 0 R
/E (The main goal of this project is to simulate a real enterprise virtualization infrastructure and gain practical experience in deploying, configuring, managing, and testing VMware vSphere technologies. Throughout this project, virtual machines were created and managed, networking and storage were configured, and cluster services were tested to ensure availability and workload balancing across hosts.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
